  "problem": "Branch copying retains source control metadata but does not replay queue/delivery events. Strict current-Run delivery validation therefore rejected inherited steering/follow-up messages during memory query preparation.",
  "implementation": [
    "Recognize local copied user history only for completed branch Runs with a matching single branch.created marker and positive source cutoff.",
    "Validate retained control ID/mode/body hash; reject mismatched markers, tampered text and mixed active control lifecycle.",
    "Preserve original event bytes and add explicit branch-copy provenance to derived requirements and query receipts.",
    "Do not expose inherited controlMode as a new local delivery; working-state source hashes include the branch marker.",
    "Allow passive context receipts on completed branches without treating summaries as instructions or counting them as copied source messages."
  ],
