  "integrationEvidence": [
    "Production queue/delivery repository methods created steering and follow_up source messages.",
    "Production createThreadBranch copied their unchanged payloads without delivery events.",
    "Both subsequent scripted-model AgentRuntime Runs failed before correction and completed after correction.",
    "Tests assert source and copied ledgers remain byte-equivalent as JSON data after execution.",
